 sts nine fruits of the Spirit. This week\, focus on one. Key verse: 1 Cori
 nthians 13:4–7.\n\nPick one step a day:\n• Do one helpful thing for so
 meone who can't repay you.\n• Listen to someone for five minutes without
  checking your phone.\n• Read 1 Corinthians 13:4–7 and put your own na
 me in place of 'love'. Where does it stop being true?\n\nAt the end of the
  week\, ask yourself where you saw this fruit grow\, and where it didn't.\
 n\n—\nFrom Ninefruit: Fruit of the Spirit\, free on the App Store: https
